<title>USA: POLL - Analysts' estimates for U.S. cattle inventory.</title>
<headline>POLL - Analysts' estimates for U.S. cattle inventory.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are analysts' estimates for Friday's semi-annual U.S. Department of Agriculture U.S. Cattle Inventory Report. In million head as of July 1, 1997 with percentage of a year earlier underneath in parentheses.</p>
<p>				   Range		 Average</p>
